WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.054 --> 00:00:04.000
The drones flew away with Mayor Bloom.

2
00:00:04.001 --> 00:00:06.942
"I have to save him!" Roxy thought.

3
00:00:06.943 --> 00:00:11.820
She shot back to Metro City Prison and grabbed the elf.

4
00:00:11.821 --> 00:00:14.330
Then she flew him to the mountains.

5
00:00:14.331 --> 00:00:18.423
On the way she explained her plan.

6
00:00:18.424 --> 00:00:23.943
"That plan sounds dangerous, Rocket Girl," the elf said nervously.

7
00:00:23.944 --> 00:00:28.159
"Just listen to me and follow my instructions," Roxy said.

8
00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:31.852
"And you'll be fine."

9
00:00:31.853 --> 00:00:38.320
After they landed, a drone led them to the cave.

10
00:00:38.321 --> 00:00:42.471
Inside, Hector Collector was sitting in a chair.

11
00:00:42.472 --> 00:00:45.718
"Whoa." Roxy looked around.

12
00:00:45.719 --> 00:00:50.707
The cave was filled with dolls and action figures of villains and superheroes.

13
00:00:50.708 --> 00:00:56.227
"Greetings, Rocket Girl. I'm glad you like my collection," Hector said.

14
00:00:56.228 --> 00:00:59.573
Roxy frowned. "I brought you the elf.

15
00:00:59.574 --> 00:01:02.886
Now you need to bring me Mayor Bloom."

16
00:01:02.887 --> 00:01:08.524
"Follow me," Hector said.

17
00:01:08.525 --> 00:01:12.245
In another room Hector tugged on a cord to open a curtain.

18
00:01:12.246 --> 00:01:15.465
"Here's more of my collection," he said.

19
00:01:15.466 --> 00:01:21.012
Roxy gasped. Behind the curtain stood a huge display case.

20
00:01:21.013 --> 00:01:24.720
The villain statues from Metro City Prison were inside.

21
00:01:24.721 --> 00:01:30.931
In the spot labeled Elf Leader stood another bronze statue—Mayor Bloom!

22
00:01:30.932 --> 00:01:35.354
"Now that you're here, Rocket Girl, I've changed my mind."

23
00:01:35.355 --> 00:01:37.647
Hector flashed an evil smile.

24
00:01:37.648 --> 00:01:40.817
Then he hit a button on a remote.

25
00:01:40.818 --> 00:01:44.434
"What's happening?" the elf cried as the room began to shake.

26
00:01:44.435 --> 00:01:46.698
Roxy stared at the display case.

27
00:01:46.699 --> 00:01:51.011
It was moving—sliding out of the mountain!

28
00:01:51.012 --> 00:01:54.315
"​​​​The display case," she said.

29
00:01:54.316 --> 00:01:58.136
"It's the belly of a giant robot!"

30
00:01:58.137 --> 00:02:05.750
Several drones picked up Hector to lift him into the robot's head.

31
00:02:05.751 --> 00:02:09.602
Hector laughed loudly.

32
00:02:09.603 --> 00:02:14.696
"I'm going to add both of you to my collection."

33
00:02:14.697 --> 00:02:18.903
The giant robot grabbed at Roxy with its claw.

34
00:02:18.904 --> 00:02:21.299
Its other hand was a big laser beam.

35
00:02:21.300 --> 00:02:25.655
The beam glowed. It was about to zap her into a statue!

36
00:02:25.656 --> 00:02:28.071
"Hey, Elf!" Roxy shouted.

37
00:02:28.072 --> 00:02:31.480
"Use your lightning bolts and shock that beam!"

38
00:02:31.481 --> 00:02:33.213
"No way!"

39
00:02:33.214 --> 00:02:39.096
"Do you want to turn into a statue?" Roxy said. "If not—do it!"

40
00:02:39.097 --> 00:02:44.307
The elf shrugged and shot a lightning bolt at the robot's hand.

41
00:02:44.308 --> 00:02:48.131
Zap! The beam stopped glowing.

42
00:02:48.132 --> 00:02:54.646
Roxy quickly freed herself from the claw and smashed the robot's arm.

43
00:02:54.647 --> 00:02:59.694
"Nice work!" Roxy said, landing next to the elf. "For a bad guy."

44
00:02:59.695 --> 00:03:02.281
Hector's face was red with anger.

45
00:03:02.282 --> 00:03:05.579
"Ugh. I'm taking my collection to a new place.

46
00:03:05.580 --> 00:03:08.595
And you'll never find it, Rocket Girl!"

47
00:03:08.596 --> 00:03:10.623
The robot shot away.

48
00:03:10.624 --> 00:03:15.419
Roxy took off after it.

49
00:03:15.420 --> 00:03:18.187
Suddenly the robot's feet lit up.

50
00:03:18.188 --> 00:03:20.637
"Uh-oh!" Roxy cried.

51
00:03:20.638 --> 00:03:29.322
Six missiles were headed straight at her!

